Protocol/ABI references (not bundled source dependencies):
- microG GmsCore checkin.proto, mcs.proto and RegisterRequest.java: Apache-2.0.
- Firebase Android SDK GmsRpc.java: Apache-2.0 (token deletion/topic protocol).
- Microsoft Windows SDK metadata / windows-rs: Windows Runtime ABI identifiers
  and interface method order. No windows-rs implementation is bundled here.

The implementation uses Windows' HTTP, TLS (SChannel), notification and socket
broker services. It contains no bundled Google/Firebase SDK, generated microG
protobuf code, TLS library, Google credentials, service account key or device
state. Wire fields and ABI layouts are described directly in the C sources.

